NOTE FOR THE AUTHORS
--------------------
This licence covers the code in this repository except for the vendored third-party
components listed below, which keep their own terms:

  * `backend/app/services/topology/providers/tm/_tmhmm/` - a NumPy port of pyTMHMM
    1.3.6 (MIT, see `_tmhmm/LICENSE`). The DTU TMHMM 2.0 model parameters are NOT in
    this repository: DTU's academic licence does not permit redistribution, so the
    user installs the model with `backend/scripts/install_tmhmm_model.py`.

  * `tools/bin/` - the Windows builds of DSSP (PDB-REDO) and STRIDE, distributed under
    their own licences.

The licence choice itself is a decision for the authors; MIT was written here as the
common default for academic research software and can be replaced by editing this file
and the `license` field of `backend/pyproject.toml`.
